@database ZZPlay.guide
@$VER: ZZPlay.guide 1.0 (29.9.2026)

@node Main "ZZPlay - the ZZ9000 accelerated media player"
ZZPlay plays MPEG-1 Program Streams and standalone MP3 files using the
ZZ9000's ARM coprocessor and FPGA video overlay. Video decoding happens on
the card; on the accelerated Zorro III path no decoded video ever crosses
the Zorro bus.

Contents

